flowchart TD
    Mention[Explicit Slack thread request] --> Intake[Verified agent receiver / sender / target / request receipt]
    Intake --> Check
    Check --> Request{Thread request present?}
    Request -->|Yes| RequestRead[Read thread and current docs; verify authority and audience]
    RequestRead --> Action{Requested write authorized?}
    Action -->|Yes| RequestWrite[Apply minimal document changes]
    RequestWrite --> RequestVerify[Reload each target and verify]
    RequestVerify --> ThreadReply[Reply in source thread: answer / changes / remaining work]
    RequestVerify --> RequestNotice[Material changes only: configured audience notification]
    RequestNotice --> Receipts
    Action -->|Needs confirmation| Questions
    Action -->|Query / proposal only| ThreadReply
    ThreadReply --> Receipts
    Tick[Every cycle] --> Preflight[Check Wispr connector / authorized identity / scoped read]
    Preflight --> Gate{Wispr prerequisite ready?}
    Gate -->|No| SourcePending[Keep Wispr pending and checkpoint; continue independent work]
    Gate -->|Yes| Check[Reconcile authorized private Decision / approved Team projection]
    SourcePending --> Check
    Request -->|No: scheduled source sync| Inputs[Read ready sources and registered docs; record coverage gaps]
    Inputs --> Scope{Audience and permissions verified?}
    Scope -->|No| Private[Owner-only pending classification]
    Scope -->|Yes| Draft[Archive evidence and update same-audience topic draft]
    Draft --> Questions[Register all unresolved questions]
    Questions --> Decision[Dedicated private Decision inbox: one question / revision / thread]
    Decision -->|Waiting / more evidence| Pending[Keep pending; continue independent safe work]
    Pending --> Tick
    Decision -->|Explicit scoped confirmation| Record[Write decision at original visibility]
    Record --> Verify[Reload and verify docs]
    Verify --> Notice[Material update to separate authorized company destination]
    Record --> Release{Exact Team publication approved?}
    Release -->|No| Hold[Keep private; no Team publication]
    Release -->|Yes| Projection[Minimal approved Team payload]
    Projection --> Team[Team docs / authorized execution]
    Team --> TeamVerify[Read back and verify]
    TeamVerify --> TeamNotice[Team material update / digest]
    Notice --> Receipts[Separate receipts and execution feedback]
    TeamNotice --> Receipts
    Receipts --> Tick
